+ \(c) 证明矩阵 $upright(bold(N)) equiv upright(bold(U)) upright(bold(s))^(- 1\/2) upright(bold(U))^(upright(T))$ 满足 $upright(bold(M)) upright(bold(N)) = upright(bold(I))$。由于 $upright(bold(M)) = upright(bold(S))^(1\/2)$，故有 $upright(bold(S))^(1\/2) upright(bold(N)) = upright(bold(I))$，从而 $upright(bold(N)) = upright(bold(S))^(- 1\/2)$，且 $upright(bold(S))^(- 1\/2) = upright(bold(U)) upright(bold(s))^(- 1\/2) upright(bold(U))^(upright(T))$。
